msgstr ""
"先靠近对手按\n"
"徒手攻击键将其制服。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Then tilt the analog stick \n"
"to throw them. "
msgstr ""
"然后推摇杆\n"
"把他摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000002
